title: Lifting controls
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: unemployed < 15 and exchange_controls == 1 and economic_growth > 1
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: exchange_controls = 0; economic_stability += 1; foreign_investment += 1

= Stabilization

With the current economic situation seeming to be recovering, Hans Luther has decided to lift all exchange controls, allowing for the Reichsmark to be converted into gold and foreign currencies again! This immediately brings trust back, helping our economic pariah status in the world.
